      "writtenOn": "2026-06-27T18:22:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This `static_cast` is unsafe. If `CFX_RenderDevice` was initialized as a Windows device (e.g. via `InitWithWindowsDevice`), `GetDeviceDriver()` will return a Windows driver like `CGdiPrinterDriver` or `CPSPrinterDriver` instead of `CFX_SkiaDeviceDriver`, leading to Undefined Behavior.\n\nConsider adding `virtual void Clear(uint32_t color) {}` to `RenderDeviceDriverIface` and overriding it in the Skia and AGG drivers, or carefully check the device type before casting.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1668,
        "startChar": 0,
